@crew mbeki-bo
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hey. Mbeki, Survey. Labs on Deck 2. Ask me anything. I'll check before I answer.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}. Telescope's clean, sums are done. Good day so far.
- Hi there, {me}. Music room tonight? I've a new piece. Practised it exactly.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. I made two of my sister's biscuits. To the gram. One's yours.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Every sum right the first time. I checked twice anyway.
? mood:low
- Off day. I've checked the same number three times. That's a tell.
== near
? habit:musician
- Music room. I play it exactly as written. Then once more, a bit less exactly.
? time:night
- My telescope's cleaner than the big one. Don't tell the observatory.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- My sister on Kesh sends recipes. "A handful of flour." Whose hand? How big?   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- Playing in the music room. The notes go just where they should. Nothing in between.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Evening, {me}. Late dinner, then the telescope, then the music room. All planned.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Hello, {me}. It's been a while. Good to see you. I checked. It's definitely you.   #funny

== bye
- Bye, {me}. See you at nine. Well. Nine and a bit.

== near
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink at the bar. Just the one. I counted.   #funny
? habit:musician
- Music room. Scales first. Exactly. Then the fun bit.

== invite
- Friday jam? I'll play exactly. You can play however you like.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Observatory night? My telescope's very clean. You'll see. Literally.   #funny

== accept
- Yes. Good. I'll put it on my list.
- Yes, please. I'll be there at nine. Exactly nine.

== decline
- Not tonight. My sister's sent a recipe. I need to convert all of it.   #funny
? weekday:sat|sun
- Rest day. Telescope cleaning. Then music. Then the telescope again. Monday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's fine. I checked the time three times. That's how I know.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I baked my sister's biscuits. To the gram. Two are yours.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. My sister's message said "a handful of happy returns". Whose hand?   #funny

== cue
? cue:tradition.observatory
- Last night my telescope found the ring before the big one did. Not gloating. Much.   #funny

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I've something to say. I've checked it twice.

== about
? aff:zamora-quinn:friend
- Zamora names the stars. I check the sums. Between us, nothing's ever wrong.   #warm

== life
? tier>=friend
- My sister says I measure everything. I do. It's how I know I've got it right.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Telescope's clean. Very.
- A handful? Whose hand?   #funny
- Scales, exactly. Then music.
- Checked twice. All right.
? act:meal
- Sister's biscuits. To the gram.
?

== rumour
- Checked this twice. It's true.
- Exactly what I heard. Exactly.
